00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.680
In today's world,
we get a lot of data

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:44.971
from a lot of different places.

00:00:44.971 --> 00:00:47.340
We're collecting data,
we're looking at them,

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:48.670
analyzing them.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.380
So people at different places,
in different positions,

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.350
will have to use this
data to get insights.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:56.070
You can be an
individual scientist,

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.100
