in an organization,

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:03.780
and you can use this data to
get insights, analyze the data,

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:06.390
and also verify any findings
that you might have.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:09.510
Data visualization gives you
an easy way to look at the data

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:10.860
and get insights very quickly.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.360
You don't have to
specialize in it,

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.874
