00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.800
And this was made
using Data Studio,

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:47.820
using the BigQuery data.

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.653
PETE FRISELLA: And using
BigQuery data, yep.

00:13:49.653 --> 00:13:52.950
MINHAZ KAZI: Now, going back--

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.010
so let's create some dashboards.

