PETE FRISELLA: Very cool.

00:28:21.750 --> 00:28:24.208
MINHAZ KAZI: So we can also
pick different years from here.

00:28:24.208 --> 00:28:26.430
You can pick different teams.

00:28:26.430 --> 00:28:27.680
If you can-- wait.

00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:31.980
Let's say Santa Cruz, and you
can see the game information

00:28:31.980 --> 00:28:32.480
there.

00:28:32.480 --> 00:28:33.750
They have only one
game over here.

00:28:33.750 --> 00:28:34.080
PETE FRISELLA: Very cool.

00:28:34.080 --> 00:28:35.922
And this report can be
shared with anybody.

00:28:35.922 --> 00:28:36.630
MINHAZ KAZI: Yes.

00:28:36.630 --> 00:28:38.940
PETE FRISELLA: It could also be
embedded in a website or blog.

00:28:38.940 --> 00:28:39.600
MINHAZ KAZI: Exactly.

00:28:39.600 --> 00:28:40.590
If you want to share
it with someone,

00:28:40.590 --> 00:28:42.214
you can just click
this button, and you

00:28:42.214 --> 00:28:44.130
can share it with someone else.

00:28:44.130 --> 00:28:47.040
You can get a sharable
link where other people can

00:28:47.040 --> 00:28:48.810
use this link directly
to view the report,

00:28:48.810 --> 00:28:51.090
or you can associate
with specific people,

00:28:51.090 --> 00:28:54.600
give them either edit
access or view access.

00:28:54.600 --> 00:28:59.460
And if you want to embed it,
we'll go back to the dashboard.

00:28:59.460 --> 00:29:03.250
What we have here is you can
go to File, Embed Report.

00:29:03.250 --> 00:29:05.890
You enable embedding, and this
gives you a nice little code

00:29:05.890 --> 00:29:06.390
snippet.

00:29:06.390 --> 00:29:08.556
You can just copy and paste
it into any website that

00:29:08.556 --> 00:29:10.380
supports the embedding--
iframe embedding--

00:29:10.380 --> 00:29:12.494
and then you will be
able to view and interact

00:29:12.494 --> 00:29:14.160
with this dashboard
within that website.

00:29:14.160 --> 00:29:15.609
PETE FRISELLA: Cool.

00:29:15.609 --> 00:29:17.400
MINHAZ KAZI: So we've
built two dashboards.

00:29:17.400 --> 00:29:19.820
We have seen how
Data Studio works.

