00:32:58.885 --> 00:33:00.010
a dashboard in Data Studio.

00:33:00.010 --> 00:33:02.746
You can go to
datastudio.google.com.

00:33:02.746 --> 00:33:04.120
If you want some
inspiration, you

00:33:04.120 --> 00:33:06.400
can go to the
datastudiogallery.appspot.com

00:33:06.400 --> 00:33:09.850
where we have dashboards from
different partners available.

00:33:09.850 --> 00:33:12.460
You can watch some
tutorials on YouTube.

00:33:12.460 --> 00:33:15.190
If you want to develop
solutions around Data Studio,

00:33:15.190 --> 00:33:19.097
you can go to our dev site at
developers.google.com/datastudio

00:33:19.097 --> 00:33:21.430
where we have information
about the community connectors

00:33:21.430 --> 00:33:22.980
and how you can build one.

00:33:22.980 --> 00:33:26.470
You can also get support at
support.google.com/datastudio.

00:33:26.470 --> 00:33:29.020
And let us know what you
build-- any cool dashboards

00:33:29.020 --> 00:33:31.309
or any new cool connectors
that you come up with.

00:33:31.309 --> 00:33:33.350
PETE FRISELLA: So thank
